> Repeated characters need a separating blank

CTC sums probabilities of time paths that collapse to the same target.
It first merges neighboring repeated classes,then removes blanks. Thus
[1,1,blank,1,blank,1] becomes "111". Removing blanks first would lose the
three separate characters. A target "00" with three time steps and classes
{0,1,blank2} has exactly one feasible path:[0,blank,0]. Its negative log
likelihood is the sum of those three negative log probabilities.

For a general target,the forward/backward lattice sums every feasible path.
Each logit derivative is \(p_{tc}-P(\pi_t=c\mid target)\),the unconditional
class probability minus its target-conditioned path occupation. Native
exhaustive enumeration checks every value/adjoint,variable lengths,padded
zero gradients,batch-mean reduction and finite differences.
```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/crnn_ctc_repeats.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  const auto logits = n::tensor({.2, -.3, .4, -.1, .5, .1, .7, -.2, .3}, {3, 1, 3});
  const auto labels = n::tensor({0, 0}, {1, 2}, n::DType::Int32),
             length = n::full({1}, 2, n::DType::Int32),
             time = n::full({1}, 3, n::DType::Int32);
  const auto result = n::ctc_loss_with_gradient(logits, labels, length, time);
  const auto probability = n::softmax(logits, 2);
  const auto logp = n::log_softmax(logits, 2).reshape({3, 3});
  const auto expected =
      -(n::select(n::select(logp, 0, 0), 0, 0) + n::select(n::select(logp, 0, 1), 0, 2) +
        n::select(n::select(logp, 0, 2), 0, 0));
  if (std::abs(result.loss.item() - expected.item()) > 1e-6)
    return 1;
  auto a = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(probability.reshape({3, 3}), {0}), 0, 1),
       b = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(result.gradient.reshape({3, 3}), {0}), -1, 1);
  a.title("Probabilities before CTC conditioning")
      .x_label("class0,class1,blank2")
      .y_label("time0 at bottom");
  b.title("All logit adjoints for target00")
      .x_label("class0,class1,blank2")
      .y_label("time0 at bottom");
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  auto layout = dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2);
  layout.add(a).add(b).size(1100, 500).fit_panels().save_svg("build/crnn_ctc_repeats.svg");
  std::print("Unique repeated-label path[0,blank,0];CTC NLL {:.6f},direct path NLL {:.6f}. "
             "Collapse[1,1,blank,1,blank,1] -> {}.\n",
             result.loss.item(), expected.item(),
             n::models::CtcCollapse({1, 1, 36, 1, 36, 1}));
}
```
